    "perIdentity": {
      "arcane-clone": "Three future caster STARTs/18 seconds retain original clock. Image is nonphysical and not a second caster. Actual unified eligible-image selection, body/contact geometry, remote suppression/resumption, and durable per-observer known-false state inspected. Corrected known-false branch forks exactly after real contact at 8.1 with live visible Clone and unspent enemy Action; attack preflight consumes no resource, and image-only speech creates no Counterspell window.",
      "arcane-reversal": "Finite eligible components, rank <=4, actual check and original parent lifetime inspected. Native Water Pet healing-to-damage exception uses actual 2d6 producer with source ownership and Null ordering, without claiming reserve-eight coverage. Corrected acquired class Dispel now commits/resolves on O turn 6.1/6.2, spends 3 RP/Action and sets recharge 2; actual START 12/18 ticks 2->1->0. Stoneflesh survives at original deadline, AC restored 11->15, lifetime reversal consumption retained in exact fork at 6.2.",
      "elemental-rebind": "Type eligibility, CON half/pass/no strip, failed-save strip before 5d10, attached first future target END/fallback clock and independent defense expiration inspected. Protective Mutations requires actual acquired passive, actual paid Stonecore/Ironhide BA activation, active mutation, allied geometry, S=3, and EACH recipient first damage per numbered round. Corrected second real paid/acquired Arcane Bolt damages same ally without second DR; separately acquired paid Bolt damages different ally with its own first DR3. Duplicate callback remains no damage. Real Ready Action/hold/concentration/Reaction, actual Mirror Image selection and concentration dice, no Evocation bonus for Universal Bolt, and legal movement/turn chronology inspected. Guardian Tissue retains actual once-per-round history plus spent Reaction and post-defense unmitigable transfer; no BT or repeat redirection.",
      "spell-sculptor": "13 RP preparation modifier on next real rank0-6 area, fixed perceived/allied roster/range/LoE at commitment, immutable Counterspell consumption and Ready targeting geometry inspected. Direct creature and coupled carried-item protection preserves terrain. Actual Ice Storm height, damage, Dash costs, persistent terrain/no replay and whole-field Antimagic co-suppression inspected; selective-only source remains explicitly unproved.",
      "spell-seal": "10 RP, 24-hour single ongoing application, exclusions and attached lifetime inspected. Seal and selected parent non-dispellable; real parent expiry/concentration loss still end it. Actual separately paid parent applications, class/ordinary counter cost distinctions, Greater Dispel immutable snapshot and suppressed no-rescan behavior inspected.",
      "spell-theft": "7 RP rank4 whole eligible <=4 buff bundle, donor WIS/waiver, unchanged creator/concentration/original clock and one transfer lifetime inspected. Real Haste separate creator, donor ending Stun, recipient same-round extra-action use history, self-creator concentration collapse, Seal/Reversal attachments, and unrelated same-name class identity exclusions inspected; absent exact Fly remains a retained source hold.",
      "resonance-communion": "10 RP one-hour permission for exactly three actual class-qualified unavailable identities beyond known/prepared allowance, with atomic replacement and no free cast/RP/formula inspected. W9 actual book/prepared capacity and all access rows verified. Paid Ready Haste survives grant expiry only to actual hold deadline, with real later trigger/Reaction and independent Haste duration; new unprepared cast after expiry and expired held release fail. Permission suppression does not recreate or erase an already paid held cast."
    }
